# CR 508.1d/508.1h: ai's Ghostly Prison taxes each attacker {2}. Human
# declares Silvercoat Lion and Grizzly Bears, pays the Lion's tax and
# declines the Bears' one. The unpaid attacker leaves combat and untaps
# (PhaseHandler.java:580-584: removeFromCombat, then setTapped(false) for a
# creature tapped only provisionally); the rest of the attack stands
# (validateAttackers again, nothing violated), so only the Lion deals damage.
startturn human
advance 5
tapformana human 3 W
tapformana human 4 W
queue attackers 1,2
queue confirmpaycost true
queue paygeneric W
queue paygeneric W
queue confirmpaycost false
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks none
declareblockers
advance
advance
